   "body": "**Adversarial review (Fable 5.2, cloud/i934-fable-review, round 3): APPROVE** — head e722ec935ea8630257132144088377abc5d4c83b\n\nThe change since cf1f6920 is comment-only (3 lines added, 2 removed, in `App/SwiftHFRTests/Reader/ReaderWebControllerTests.swift:200-203`). It answers round-2 finding 1: the watch's second chance is now described as the likely cause of jobs 133110414600 and 133160363316, read from the code, with the failure message named as the way to confirm it. No code or assertion changed, so the round-2 analysis stands.\n\nStill open, neither blocking:\n\n1. **Detail — `ReaderWebControllerTests.swift:204`.** `reports.posts == [2]` is exact. A late WebKit reset followed by a re-landing delayed more than 500 ms would give `[1, 2]` and fail the wait. That is narrow, and the message shows the list. Keep the exact check.\n2. **Tracking.** The #934 criteria (cause confirmed by evidence, 20 consecutive green runs) are not met by the merge alone: keep the issue open until the runs are in. The product side is tracked in #959.\n\n**Verified:** read `git diff cf1f6920..e722ec9`; `swiftlint lint` on the changed file at this head is clean. The app tests cannot be built or run on Linux, so nothing was executed.\n\n---\n_Generated by [Claude Code](https://claude.ai/code)_",
